1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,492
The World Health Organization defines health as complete physical, mental and social well being, not merely the absence of disease.

2
00:00:09,492 --> 00:00:21,080
Diseases fall into three groups: communicable, caused by a pathogen that passes between people; non communicable, which are not transmitted; and deficiency diseases.

